sentences.text:
Any person who,
 whether by himself or by any other person on his  behalf, manufactures for sale or stores or sells or  distributes or imports any article of food for human  consumption which is unsafe, shall be punishable,--
 (i) where such failure or contravention does not  result in injury, with imprisonment for a term which  may extend to six months and also with fine which  may extend to one lakh rupees;
